380	     * {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + (email or empty) + '|' + householdId}. The telephone and
381	     * email are already stored in their canonical (E.164 / lower-cased) form, so a {@code null} or
382	     * blank email contributes an empty segment and an absent {@code householdId} an empty segment.
383	     * Two owners are duplicates only when their whole {@code identityKey} is equal.
384	     */
385	    @Transient
